{"name": "s1", "dur": 44.97, "lines": [{"id": "p01", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 1.93, "clip": 0.3, "text": "你发出去的每张照片，", "ch": [0.35, 0.508, 0.666, 0.824, 0.982, 1.14, 1.298, 1.456, 1.614, 1.772], "sub": null, "big": "你发出去的每张照片，", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "p02", "t0": 2.33, "t1": 3.8, "clip": 2.27, "text": "在芯片之间都要跑一趟。", "ch": [2.33, 2.464, 2.597, 2.731, 2.865, 2.998, 3.132, 3.265, 3.399, 3.533, 3.666], "sub": null, "big": "在芯片之间都要跑一趟。", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "p02b", "t0": 4.2, "t1": 8.57, "clip": 4.15, "text": "你问 AI 的每个问题、发的每张照片，背后都是芯片之间在疯狂寄快递。", "ch": [4.2, 4.302, 4.403, 4.505, 4.607, 4.708, 4.81, 4.912, 5.013, 5.115, 5.217, 5.318, 5.54, 5.649, 5.757, 5.866, 5.974, 6.083, 6.191, 6.44, 6.582, 6.724, 6.866, 7.008, 7.15, 7.292, 7.434, 7.576, 7.718, 7.86, 8.002, 8.144, 8.286, 8.428], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "p03", "t0": 9.02, "t1": 12.38, "clip": 8.96, "text": "直觉上，修几十条路，把照片切成几十条一起送，最快。", "ch": [9.02, 9.154, 9.289, 9.423, 9.558, 9.692, 9.826, 9.961, 10.095, 10.23, 10.364, 10.498, 10.633, 10.767, 10.902, 11.036, 11.17, 11.305, 11.439, 11.574, 11.708, 11.842, 11.977, 12.111, 12.246], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "p04", "t0": 12.63, "t1": 16.49, "clip": 12.58, "text": "慢的时候确实没问题：每一条都按时到，照片拼得严丝合缝。", "ch": [12.63, 12.749, 12.868, 12.987, 13.106, 13.225, 13.344, 13.463, 13.582, 13.701, 13.99, 14.121, 14.252, 14.384, 14.515, 14.646, 14.777, 14.909, 15.14, 15.29, 15.44, 15.59, 15.74, 15.89, 16.04, 16.19, 16.34], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "p05", "t0": 16.94, "t1": 22.29, "clip": 16.88, "text": "可速度一快，一张紧跟着一张；哪条路长了一点点，那一条就晚到半步，拼进了下一张。", "ch": [16.94, 17.077, 17.214, 17.352, 17.489, 17.626, 17.763, 17.9, 18.037, 18.175, 18.312, 18.449, 18.586, 18.723, 18.861, 18.998, 19.135, 19.272, 19.409, 19.546, 19.684, 19.821, 19.958, 20.095, 20.232, 20.369, 20.507, 20.644, 20.781, 20.918, 21.055, 21.193, 21.33, 21.467, 21.604, 21.741, 21.878, 22.016, 22.153], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "p06", "t0": 23.44, "t1": 24.22, "clip": 23.39, "text": "照片就成了这样。", "ch": [23.44, 23.537, 23.635, 23.732, 23.83, 23.927, 24.025, 24.122], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "p07", "t0": 24.47, "t1": 28.18, "clip": 24.4, "text": "聊天、转账也一样：没有纠错的话，错一位，意思就全变了。", "ch": [24.47, 24.607, 24.745, 24.882, 25.02, 25.157, 25.294, 25.432, 25.569, 25.707, 25.844, 25.981, 26.119, 26.256, 26.394, 26.531, 26.669, 26.806, 26.943, 27.081, 27.218, 27.356, 27.493, 27.63, 27.768, 27.905, 28.043], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "p08", "t0": 28.43, "t1": 30.51, "clip": 28.36, "text": "路越多，越难让每一条都一样长。", "ch": [28.43, 28.569, 28.707, 28.846, 28.985, 29.123, 29.262, 29.401, 29.539, 29.678, 29.817, 29.955, 30.094, 30.233, 30.371], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "p09", "t0": 30.96, "t1": 37.27, "clip": 30.9, "text": "所以最快的芯片反过来：只修几条路，让数据排成一队，一个接一个跑。不用等谁，就能越跑越快。", "ch": [30.96, 31.103, 31.247, 31.39, 31.534, 31.677, 31.82, 31.964, 32.107, 32.251, 32.394, 32.537, 32.681, 32.824, 32.968, 33.111, 33.255, 33.398, 33.541, 33.685, 33.828, 33.972, 34.115, 34.258, 34.402, 34.545, 34.689, 34.832, 34.975, 35.119, 35.262, 35.406, 35.549, 35.692, 35.836, 35.979, 36.123, 36.266, 36.41, 36.553, 36.696, 36.84, 36.983, 37.127], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "p10", "t0": 37.72, "t1": 38.47, "clip": 37.66, "text": "一句话带走：", "ch": [37.72, 37.845, 37.97, 38.095, 38.22, 38.345], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "p11", "t0": 38.72, "t1": 39.95, "clip": 38.67, "text": "路少，反而不会乱。", "ch": [38.72, 38.85, 38.98, 39.25, 39.367, 39.483, 39.6, 39.717, 39.833], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "p12", "t0": 40.2, "t1": 43.37, "clip": 40.13, "text": "下一条：排成一队以后，对面怎么知道数到了第几个？", "ch": [40.2, 40.307, 40.415, 40.522, 40.83, 40.95, 41.07, 41.19, 41.31, 41.43, 41.55, 41.79, 41.912, 42.033, 42.155, 42.276, 42.398, 42.519, 42.641, 42.762, 42.884, 43.005, 43.127, 43.248], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}], "shots": [{"kind": "photo", "t0": 0, "paper": false, "first": "p01", "t1": 3.9}, {"kind": "route", "t0": 3.9, "paper": false, "first": "p02b", "topic": "为什么排成一队寄", "t1": 8.72}, {"kind": "strips", "t0": 8.72, "paper": false, "first": "p03", "t1": 30.66}, {"kind": "serial", "t0": 30.66, "paper": false, "first": "p09", "t1": 37.42}, {"kind": "take", "t0": 37.42, "paper": true, "first": "p10", "type": [{"text": "一句话带走", "line": "p10", "from": null, "to": null}, {"text": "路少，", "line": "p11", "from": "路少", "to": "路少"}, {"text": "反而不会乱。", "line": "p11", "from": "反而", "to": "不会乱"}], "cy": 700, "t1": 44.97}], "hudIn": 8.72}